# Parallax layer 1 (farthest): night sky, moon, stars, cloud streaks.
# 320x180, opaque, wraps horizontally. Scroll factor ~0.05.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 320 180
@output ../backgrounds/bg_sky.png
@preview ../previews/bg_sky_x2.png 2

@frame sky




















































































































































































